        <mxCell id="description" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Inside one environment&amp;#x27;s resource group: requests pass the WAF and Front Door, then reach the Static Web App with the Front Door ID header. Application Insights probes the public URLs. Front Door and test results feed Log Analytics, which the alerts and the workbook dashboard query. Alerts fire through the Action Group to email and webhooks." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5c5c5c;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;">
